 AI Usage Disclosure

During the development of Health Guardian, our team used AI tools such as ChatGPT and Google Gemini to make the development process easier and more efficient.

We used these tools to brainstorm ideas, plan application features, understand code, get coding suggestions, fix errors, and improve the application step by step.

However, the AI-generated suggestions were not used blindly. Our team reviewed them, made the necessary changes, and worked on integrating and testing the application to ensure everything functioned properly.

AI tools were only used to support our development work. The final coding decisions, implementation, testing, and overall responsibility for the project belong to our team.
